        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "4. A) It may increase the expenses of sports competitions.\nB) It may lead to athletes' over-reliance on equipment.\nC) It may give an unfair advantage to some athletes.\nD) It may change the nature of sports competitions.",
      "block_bbox": [
